OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make film to deter pupils
OL,4,Afrom petty theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new short film made by West Midlands
OL,7,FPolice is set to be shown in schools
OL,8,Facross the region to help deter pupils
OL,9,Ffrom petty theft and anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour (ASB).
OL,12,FIt will form part of a wider campaign
OL,13,Fand demonstrate the harm theft and ASB
OL,14,Fcan have on local businesses, and how
OL,15,Fit can also escalate into more serious
OL,16,Fcrime.
OL,18,FIn May, the BBC reported that recorded
OL,19,Fshoplifting had risen by 30.2% with
OL,20,F31,620 offences in the 12 months to
OL,21,FMarch 2025, up from 24,295 in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
