OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make film to deter pupils
OL,4,Afrom petty theft
OL,5,
OL,6,FJacqui Every, Business Crime Officer
OL,7,Ffor West Midlands Police, said the
OL,8,Fforce wanted the film to be a
OL,9,F"prevention tool" that could be used in
OL,10,Fschools to "make young people think
OL,11,Ftwice about committing crimes."
